/T (Similarly, the Women in Tech Incubator in the Philippines offers a package of mentorship, product development support, and seed grants to female-led tech startups. These targeted incubators often incorporate training on soft skills and confidence-building and women mentor networks to address gender-specific needs. They also actively link participants to angel investors and venture capital that are interested in women-led ventures, which is a crucial step in the process given that women entrepreneurs globally receive a disproportionately small share of venture funding due to prevailing gender norms.)
