1067 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 363 0 R
/E (The ASEAN Digital Literacy Programme \(ADLP\) is another example of a regionally coordinated yet locally grounded initiative designed to counter digital exclusion and disinformation, particularly among vulnerable populations. Launched in 2022 by the ASEAN Foundation, the program was developed amid growing concerns over online misinformation, hate speech, and gender-based cyber harassment in Southeast Asia. Recognizing this gap, ADLP took a preventative approach by promoting not just access to digital tools, but the capacity to evaluate, interpret, and engage with digital content critically.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
