/P 363 0 R
/E (To ensure accountability and continuous improvement, Kominfo has implemented a combination of M&E tools such as feedback loops, progress tracking, and public reporting mechanisms. This allows the initiative not only to measure its outreach but also to refine its approach based on participant feedback and emerging digital trends. One example of this is the Indeks Masyarakat Digital Indonesia \(IMDI\) which annually measures digital literacy, infrastructure, and economic empowerment across 514 districts and municipalities.)
/Pg 60 0 R
/K []
